<title>UKRAINE: Belarus Belenergo to replace fuel, energy ministry.</title>
<headline>Belarus Belenergo to replace fuel, energy ministry.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The former Soviet republic of Belarus will form an energy company called Belenergo to replace the Ministry of Fuel and Energy, the presidential press service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Belenergo will join Beltopgas and the recently-formed Belneftekhim in reporting directly to the government, lead by President Alexander Lukashenko.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
